/target
# Unanchored: the MCP server defaults to `./mnesio-data` relative to its CWD,
# so a benchmark run drops one wherever the harness was launched from. An
# anchored `/mnesio-data` missed the nested copies and one was committed.
mnesio-data/
/mneme-data
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock
.DS_Store
# Runtime cache the fastembed crate downloads on first run (~100MB).
.fastembed_cache/
# Project-brief source documents (kept locally, not part of the source release).
mnesio-project-brief.docx
mnesio-project-brief.txt
CLAUDE.md

# Node SDK build artifacts
sdk/node/node_modules/
sdk/node/dist/
sdk/node/package-lock.json
sdk/node/.last_build_hash

# Downloaded benchmark cache (mnesio-bench fetch)
crates/mnesio-bench/data/cache/

# Website (Astro + Starlight) build artifacts
website/node_modules/
website/dist/
website/.astro/
# Note: website/package-lock.json IS committed — CI needs it for `npm ci`
# and setup-node's dependency cache.

# Local agent/editor tooling config — not part of the published project
.claude/

# Secrets — never commit. mnesio reads all API keys from the environment only.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
credentials.json
